vanced standing</h5> </p> <p>You may be able to reduce the number of units to be studied in your chosen course by measuring skills acquired through work, life experiences or qualifications obtained from formal studies or training. <a href="/current-students/course-resources/enrolment/advanced-standing-and-credits">Read more about gaining advanced standing and credits.</a></p>',
    apply_form = 'https://www.holmesglen.edu.au/explore-courses/english-education-and-teacher-training/early-childhood-education/higher-education/bachelor-of-early-childhood-education-int',
    updated_at = NOW()
