UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Course Overview</h4>The MSF30322 Certificate III in Cabinet Making and Timber Technology provides practical training for careers in cabinet making, furniture manufacturing and timber joinery. This course develops hands-on skills in designing, manufacturing and installing cabinetry for kitchens, bathrooms and furniture projects. Students learn to interpret plans, select materials, use hand and power tools, and operate CNC machinery in a workshop environment. With a strong focus on safety, quality and teamwork, graduates are well prepared for employment across the cabinetry and furniture industry.',
