UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<h4>Course Overview</h4>The FNS50222 Diploma of Accounting provides an advanced understanding of financial reporting, income tax returns, auditing, business performance analysis, and accounting law within the Australian business environment. Through interactive classes and hands-on projects, you’ll gain practical skills in accounting applications, preparing you for entry-level accounting positions. This diploma equips you with the expertise needed to thrive in the accounting profession.',
